## Why This Is Asked

Tests ability to build a scalable, privacy-preserving ML pipeline that composes multiple AWS services (S3, Step Functions, Lambda, SageMaker) with governance and observability.

## Key Concepts

- Event-driven pipelines with S3 triggers
- Step Functions coordinating Lambda and SageMaker
- PII redaction in Lambda
- SageMaker inference integration for sentiment and topics
- Data governance: KMS encryption, least-privilege IAM, auditing
- Reliability: DLQ, retries, monitoring, cost controls

## Code Example

```javascript
// Lambda pseudocode for redacting PII from JSON input
exports.handler = async (event) => {
  const data = JSON.parse(event.body || '{}');
  if (data.email) data.email = '[REDACTED]';
  if (data.phone) data.phone = '[REDACTED]';
  return { redacted: true, data };
};
```

## Follow-up Questions

- How would you validate redaction quality and model bias at scale?
- What strategies ensure latency targets under burst traffic?
- How would you enforce data-retention policies and revocation requests across services?

## Why This Is Asked
Explores multi-tenant data isolation, real-time latency, and policy governance in production-grade AI pipelines beyond prior questions.

## Key Concepts
- Real-time streaming with Kinesis Data Streams
- SageMaker model versioning and endpoints
- Per-tenant isolation in DynamoDB with TTL and encryption
- PII redaction before archival in S3
- IAM, KMS, VPC endpoints, and cost-monitoring

## Code Example
```javascript
const AWS = require('aws-sdk');
const sage = new AWS.SageMakerRuntime();
async function score(msg) {
  const res = await sage.invokeEndpoint({
    EndpointName: 'moderation-v1',
    ContentType: 'text/plain',
    Body: msg
  }).promise();
  return res.Body.toString();
}
```

## Follow-up Questions
- How would you test tenant isolation and data leakage risks?
- Describe a canary deployment strategy for new model versions in SageMaker.
- What monitoring dashboards and SLOs would you implement for latency and accuracy?
- How would you handle model drift and feature changes across tenants?
